# Section 3 - Authority and Associated Information
(3)  This Policy is made under the [La Trobe University Act 2009](https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/directory/summary.php?legislation=8).
(4)  Associated information includes:
  1. [Child Safety and Wellbeing Policy](https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=294)
  2. [Child Safety Statement of Commitment](http://www.latrobe.edu.au/statements/child-safety)
  3. [Child Wellbeing and Safety Act 2005](https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/directory/summary.php?legislation=124)


