  1. the [La Trobe Course Architecture](https://intranet.latrobe.edu.au/__data/assets/pdf_file/0019/383320/Course-Design-Policy-The-La-Trobe-Course-Architecture-2024-Approved-Sept-2024-2.pdf) which outlines course structures for all coursework courses, including course archetypes and sub-subject architecture;
