  2. Overseas - at least four (4) months in advance of the strategic University work requiring to be performed or the request will be refused.


(45)  The staff member’s email must:
  1. detail the reason for their request;
  2. expected timeframe for the Interstate or Overseas Work Arrangement; and
  3. consideration of the following: 
    1. productivity gains or losses;
    2. ability to attend on campus where required by their role;
    3. the potential impact on their team and other relevant staff;
    4. that workplace health and safety requirements will be met; and 
    5. impact on operational requirements and the needs to the local work unit.

