    1. full-time 
    2. part-time or fractional; and
    3. part-year or annualised hours.
  2. all forms of paid Outside Work performed by Professional Staff outside the circumstances provided in clause 4 of this Policy, whether via an employment arrangement, as a University consultant or independent consultant, contractor, business owner, director, or board member.


