(13)  Where the respondent is a La Trobe staff member or a student, the matter will be managed/investigated in accordance with [Sexual Harm Prevention and Response Policy](https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=337) and the [Enterprise Agreement](https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/download.php?id=422&version=2&associated).
