(10)  This Charter is made under the [La Trobe University Act 2009](https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/directory/summary.php?legislation=8).
(11)  Associated information includes:
  1. [Academic Progression Review Policy](https://policies.latrobe.edu.au/document/view.php?id=220)
